\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.1}{\ignorespaces The synthetic-data pipeline, from identifiable source records to documented release. Differential privacy, when used, enters at one point only: the noisy training of the generator (DP-SGD). Everything downstream is post-processing and inherits the guarantee. Release is gated on two independent checks, a utility check and a privacy audit; failing either sends the analyst back to retrain with a different method or a looser or tighter epsilon.}}{141}{figure.caption.20}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig-synth-pipeline}{{6.1}{141}{The synthetic-data pipeline, from identifiable source records to documented release. Differential privacy, when used, enters at one point only: the noisy training of the generator (DP-SGD). Everything downstream is post-processing and inherits the guarantee. Release is gated on two independent checks, a utility check and a privacy audit; failing either sends the analyst back to retrain with a different method or a looser or tighter epsilon}{figure.caption.20}{}}
