\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9.1}{\ignorespaces The evidence-synthesis pipeline mapped onto its PRISMA stages, from multi-database search through to synthesis and GRADE certainty rating. Blue nodes are stages where an LLM assists (screening, extraction); gold diamonds are the human verification gate that every LLM output must clear before it moves downstream. Search and deduplication remain deterministic tooling; the final synthesis and certainty judgement remain the reviewer's. The recurring gate is the design's answer to the asymmetry that a missed relevant study is the costly error.}}{198}{figure.caption.26}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig-prisma-pipeline}{{9.1}{198}{The evidence-synthesis pipeline mapped onto its PRISMA stages, from multi-database search through to synthesis and GRADE certainty rating. Blue nodes are stages where an LLM assists (screening, extraction); gold diamonds are the human verification gate that every LLM output must clear before it moves downstream. Search and deduplication remain deterministic tooling; the final synthesis and certainty judgement remain the reviewer's. The recurring gate is the design's answer to the asymmetry that a missed relevant study is the costly error}{figure.caption.26}{}}
