\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9.2}{\ignorespaces Illustrative trade-off between reviewer workload saved and the recall the automated screener is calibrated to hold, for a living review feeding an outbreak-response guideline. Higher recall (fewer missed relevant studies) leaves less to auto-exclude, so workload saved falls; the fall steepens as recall approaches one. The dashed line marks a common operating target of ninety-five percent recall. The vertical band on the right is the region where the costly error, missing a relevant study, is minimized but the labor saved is small. Numbers are illustrative, not from a specific review.}}{205}{figure.caption.27}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig-screening-workload}{{9.2}{205}{Illustrative trade-off between reviewer workload saved and the recall the automated screener is calibrated to hold, for a living review feeding an outbreak-response guideline. Higher recall (fewer missed relevant studies) leaves less to auto-exclude, so workload saved falls; the fall steepens as recall approaches one. The dashed line marks a common operating target of ninety-five percent recall. The vertical band on the right is the region where the costly error, missing a relevant study, is minimized but the labor saved is small. Numbers are illustrative, not from a specific review}{figure.caption.27}{}}
