\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {11.1}{\ignorespaces Common algorithmic-fairness metrics, what each equalizes across subgroups, and what each leaves unaddressed. No single metric is sufficient; the impossibility results mean that satisfying one often precludes another, so a deployment must state which criterion it targets and why.}}{245}{table.11.1}\protected@file@percent }
