\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {12.1}{\ignorespaces The five frameworks a health researcher is most likely to meet, and what each is for. The binding regimes (FDA, EU AI Act) govern products; the voluntary frameworks (WHO, NIST, CHAI) supply governance structure and are where most population-health work finds its obligations.}}{259}{table.12.1}\protected@file@percent }
