\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {14.1}{\ignorespaces The deployment lifecycle as a monitoring loop. Validation and shadow mode gate the initial release, but the load-bearing structure is the monitoring cycle: the deployed model is continually evaluated against fresh data, dataset shift is detected as a material drop in performance, and a human decides whether to continue, adjust the prompt or pipeline, retrain, or roll back to a known-good version. A deployment without this loop degrades silently, as Google Flu Trends did.}}{299}{figure.caption.38}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig-deployment-lifecycle}{{14.1}{299}{The deployment lifecycle as a monitoring loop. Validation and shadow mode gate the initial release, but the load-bearing structure is the monitoring cycle: the deployed model is continually evaluated against fresh data, dataset shift is detected as a material drop in performance, and a human decides whether to continue, adjust the prompt or pipeline, retrain, or roll back to a known-good version. A deployment without this loop degrades silently, as Google Flu Trends did}{figure.caption.38}{}}
\BKM@entry{id=220,dest={73656374696F6E2E31342E34},srcline={11373},srcfile={2E2F696E6465782E746578}}{}
